rticipation in sustainable urban projects.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_010', 'TVET', 'Sustainable construction & technological solutions', 'Use green building techniques, passive solar design, and renewable energy.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_011', 'TVET', 'Sustainable construction & technological solutions', 'Apply GIS, BIM, and smart city systems for sustainable urban planning.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_012', 'TVET', 'Project management', 'Lead sustainability projects from planning to execution, including budgeting and team coordination.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_013', 'TVET', 'Urban mobility & transportation', 'Plan bike lanes, EV infrastructure, pedestrian-friendly streets, and promote low-carbon transport.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_014', 'TVET', 'Water & environmental management', 'Design and implement rainwater harvesting, irrigation systems, and ecosystem restoration.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_015', 'TVET', 'Water & environmental management', 'Support biodiversity, green corridors, and environmental stewardship.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_016', 'TVET', 'Critical thinking & ethical decision-making', 'Encourage solution-oriented thinking, ethical use of resources, and long-term sustainability in urban development.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_017', 'TVET', 'Critical thinking & ethical decision-making', 'Design and apply creative, practical solutions to sustainability challenges.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_018', 'TVET', 'Critical thinking & ethical decision-making', 'Use design thinking to improve energy efficiency, reduce waste, and enhance urban systems.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_019', 'TVET', 'Collaboration & community engagement', 'Support teamwork across sectors and involve communities in sustainable urban initiatives.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TVET_020', 'TVET', 'Collaboration & community engagement', 'Promote collective action in green projects, recycling, and urban biodiversity.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_001', 'Tertiary education', 'Urban planning and resilient housing design', 'Design, plan and implement urban spaces that are sustainable, inclusive and resilient, integrating green infrastructure and sustainable mobility options. Focus on flood-resilient housing and carbon emissions mitigation.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_002', 'Tertiary education', 'Urban planning and resilient housing design', 'Create urban master plans incorporating flood-resistant housing, low-carbon mobility infrastructure and green spaces to improve urban resilience against climate change.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_003', 'Tertiary education', 'Urban planning and resilient housing design', 'Apply policies that mandate resilience in housing design, such as building codes for flood-prone areas, ensuring alignment with national and international climate adaptation frameworks.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_004', 'Tertiary education', 'Application of innovative urban governance', 'Introduce and apply innovative governance models that support sustainable urban development, particularly in environmentally at-risk areas.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_005', 'Tertiary education', 'Application of innovative urban governance', 'Implement adaptive urban governance strategies to manage climate-related risks, including building regulations and resilient community programmes.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_006', 'Tertiary education', 'Application of innovative urban governance', 'Engage with policy frameworks that enable smart governance, urban planning reforms, and climate adaptation integration at local, regional and national levels.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_007', 'Tertiary education', 'Using urban spaces for food and employment security', 'Repurpose urban spaces for local food production and employment opportunities, especially in underserved inner-city areas.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_008', 'Tertiary education', 'Using urban spaces for food and employment security', 'Develop urban agriculture initiatives and community-based businesses that provide fresh food and create jobs, supporting food security and economic resilience.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_TER_009', 'Tertiary education', 'Using urban spaces for food and employment security', 'Promote policies supporting urban agriculture, local business incubation and green job creation through zoning regulations and incentives for sustainable enterprises.', 'Active') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;